{"unit_id":"UncleK__dsh-think-translate#feature-1","repo":"UncleK/dsh-think-translate","commit":"2782fea1dbeb43c49935a6205da6b86aa32afdfe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-translate 的功能「思考链翻译」：将思考区段按段落和句子分批翻译，并提供预翻译、懒加载历史或展开后翻译等模式。用户可在设置中选择目标语言和翻译模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3362-3365","lib/client.js:1336"]}
{"unit_id":"UncleK__dsh-think-translate#feature-2","repo":"UncleK/dsh-think-translate","commit":"2782fea1dbeb43c49935a6205da6b86aa32afdfe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-translate 的功能「任务与回答翻译」：把任务卡片、输入区任务列表以及回答正文显示为目标语言，相关内容可通过独立开关控制。译文用于界面展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3365-3371","lib/client.js:3470-3485"]}
