{"unit_id":"UncleK__dsh-think-translate#feature-4","repo":"UncleK/dsh-think-translate","commit":"2782fea1dbeb43c49935a6205da6b86aa32afdfe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-translate 的功能「术语表」：用户可按目标语言编辑术语对，并选择启用自定义词条或内置技术词表。翻译时术语表用于保持专名和技术词汇的译法一致。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/glossary.js:1","lib/client.js:3225-3320"]}
